constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 5*10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(N)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def help_classmate(self, arr, n):
		stack = []
		ans = []
		for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):
			while len(stack) > 0 and stack[-1] >= arr[i]:
				stack.pop()
			if len(stack) > 0:
				ans.append(stack[-1])
			else:
				ans.append(-1)
			stack.append(arr[i])
		return ans[::-1]
